// InteractActionString :
"P3880923093" "examining..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P935097215" "You have taken records and recordings of the monument."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3561177086" "You got the records of the monument Dr. Boyd asked for."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2931581458" "These are exquisite, {HeroName}! With enough of these, we may eventually be able to build up a complete alphabet for this language. Assuming it uses one. <br>Look, you can see the smooth, flowing nature of the carvings. It's like these monuments weren't so much carved as grown. And that's not even starting to think about how they retain natural anti-gravitation. One mystery at a time, I suppose."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Boyd_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MonumentRecords 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2224120311" "Monument Records"
// DetailString :
"P3444656049" "You recorded these pictures and measurements of hidden monuments in the area around Firebase Zulu for Dr. Bruce Boyd."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2681718588" "We've received a report of several hidden monuments deep in some of the nearby caves. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>We'd like to investigate to see if the reports are true</A>, but my own people can't get in there, owing to an infestation of Rularuu. General Hammond isn't willing to risk a mission just for archeological purposes, so I thought perhaps I could ask you?"
// AcceptString :
"P2587592907" "Investigate presence of hidden monuments"
// SendOffString :
"P1813271305" "Thank you so much, {HeroName}. I'm glad that you're willing to help on this. As I mentioned, there are Rularuu infesting the caverns where the monuments are supposed located, but defeating them is by no means an imperative. All you need to do is get recordings of the monuments, if they exist."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3222766679" "Find Monuments"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P693229297" "If the monuments are there, get some detailed records and photos of them for me. Don't worry about risking your life or anything."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1295077076" "The Rularuu are definitely here. You wonder if the monuments you're looking for are here as well."

