"P3613783816" "You found the monuments and got the records of them Dr. Boyd asked for."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1941944499" "The monuments were there! I knew it! Superb work, {HeroName}. I knew I could trust this to you. <br><br>I wonder if the proximity and type of monuments mean something. Could that be another semantic layer? From what we've learned of the language, I wouldn't doubt it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Boyd_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MonumentRecords 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3719688580" "We've received a report of a hidden monument grotto in some of the caves. Unfortunately, the location has become over-run by the Rularuu, and General Hammond isn't willing to risk sending men in for the sake of archaeology. Honestly, I can't blame him. However, <A HREF={ACCEPT}>we would still like to investigate to see if the reports are true</A>, so I thought perhaps I could ask you for help?"
// AcceptString :
"P567550091" "Investigate monument grotto"
// SendOffString :
"P2732695643" "I knew that would pique your interest, {HeroName}! Well, I've marked the location of the grotto, if it exists. If you find monuments down there, please get recordings of all of them for us. Every bit of information gets us closer to uncovering the true history of this place."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2835109310" "Find Monument grotto"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2376173627" "You can hear the sounds of the Rularuu echoing off the smooth walls"

