// IntroString :
"P1081206766" "{HeroName}, there's been quite a tragedy! Our explorers were told about some fascinating monuments in a series of underground caves by some of the natives. My researchers and their guides were exploring these when they were attacked by the Rularuu, and now we've lost contact with them! I'm very concerned for their safety, and was hoping that you could <A HREF={ACCEPT}>try to find the missing researchers and guides.</A> Will you help?"
// AcceptString :
"P2373205170" "Look for the missing researchers and guides."
// SendOffString :
"P1358182551" "Let me thank you, {HeroName}. I'm so glad that you're willing to help. I've marked the location of the caves they entered. You're only objective is to find all of those people before something happens to them. <br><br>The monuments they went to look for might also be there, but that's purely secondary."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2056388196" "Find missing people"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2628003018" "Those people are counting on you, {HeroName}. I know you won't let them down."

